Alembic migrations for the pulse-check analytical store.

Run from project root:

    alembic upgrade head            # apply all pending
    alembic downgrade -1            # revert one step
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

`env.py` reads DATABASE_URL from `pulse_check.settings`, which loads `.env`.
Target metadata is `pulse_check.storage.models.Base.metadata`.
